  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certifies that on the 08 September 2025, the existing use of 137 Ash Grove, TW5 9DX as an HMO within a Class C4 use was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. The evidence supplied establishes that on the balance of probabilities the change of use from a residential dwelling (C3) to a house of multiple occupation (C4) occurred prior to the introduction of the Article 4 Direction."
